cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the software release and
  the paper it accompanies.
type: software
title: "Circwood WP4: Norwegian wood material- and carbon-flow dataset and pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible material- and carbon-flow analysis of Norwegian wood,
  2012–2024: from roundwood removals through sawmills, pulp mills and board mills
  to use, energy and export, built from Statistics Norway (SSB) tables and the
  Treindustrien annual report. Ships the tidy flow table, a species-accurate
  carbon-conserving carbon overlay with an uncertainty envelope, the empirical
  harvested-wood-product fraction β with one-at-a-time sensitivity bounds, a
  first-order-decay HWP carbon stock, the SSB forest-inventory resource layer,
  and a gated, self-refreshing data pipeline.
authors:
